      "value": "Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed.Req ID prefix: **PRD**.\n\n⚠️ **Rows with strikethrough are out of scope** — struck through in the Excel source file.\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Req ID | Functional Area | Sub-Functional Area | Requirement | Owner | Storefront | Config/Custom | Status | Comments | User Story Link |\n| PRD-001 | Product & Catalogue | Core Product Information | The system should display breadcrumb navigation on all PDP pages. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20%22PRD-001%22> |\n| PRD-002 | Product & Catalogue | Core Product Information | The system should display product name, price, sizes, ~~and colour swatches~~ sourced from AP21 via Product API |  | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20%22PRD-002%22> |\n| PRD-003 | Product & Catalogue | Core Product Information | The system should display a 'Was/Now' display if there is a sale price. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRD-003> |\n| PRD-004 | Product & Catalogue | Core Product Information | The system should display \"Also available in\" / \"Only available in\" colour swatches; selecting a colour should update the page content and URL. |  | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRD-004> |\n| PRD-005 | Product & Catalogue | Product Badges & Tags | The system should assign a badge on applicable products (Campaign, Runway, Exclusive, Online Exclusive, and VIC Exclusive) | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | New badge should be configurable. Badges are clickable on PDP and redirects to PLP view of that badge category | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20%22PRD-005%22> |\n| PRD-006 | Product & Catalogue | Product Badges & Tags | The system should support multiple badges per product, with a defined display priority/hierarchy when more than one badge is applied. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRD-006> |\n| PRD-007 | Product & Catalogue | Core Product Information | The system should display the Style Code (SKU). | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRD-007> |\n| PRD-008 | Product & Catalogue | Core Product Information | The system should display key supporting information in expandable accordions: Details, Size & Fit, Care, and Shipping & Free Returns (region-specific content). | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRD-008> |\n| PRD-009 | Product & Catalogue | EU Compliance | The system should display an Environmental Qualities accordion on the PDP for products assigned the relevant attribute, in compliance with AGEC law requirements for EU storefronts. The accordion should only render when product-specific environmental qualities data exists and must not display placeholder or generic copy. Data and content coming from AP21 | Accenture | EN-EU, FR-EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRD-009> |\n| PRD-010 | Product & Catalogue | Product States & Availability | The system should support a Coming Soon product state that allows products to be displayed on the PDP before stock has been added or the product enabled for purchase. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRD-010> |\n| PRD-011 | Product & Catalogue | Core Product Information | The system should enforce a configurable maximum purchase quantity per customer group for simple and configurable products. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-011> |\n| PRD-012 | Product & Catalogue | Core Product Information | The system should show 'LOW' when stock has exceeded its threshold and is in low quantity. This indicator is purely visual and does not alter CTA behaviour or block add-to-bag. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-012> |\n| PRD-013 | Product & Catalogue | Core Product Information | The system should display duties and taxes information which is country specific. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-013> |\n| PRD-014 | Product & Catalogue | Product States & Availability | The system should display a size swatch that is greyed out/disabled representing a fully unavailable size and suppresses the Unavailable CTA for that size variant. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-014> |\n| PRD-015 | Product & Catalogue | Product States & Availability | The system should support a Back in Soon product state, displayed on the PDP when a product has sold out but will restock imminently (re-cut) | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-015> |\n| PRD-016 | Product & Catalogue | Product States & Availability | The system should support an Unavailable product state at size level, triggering the Notify Me flow for the affected size variant. | Accenture | ALL |  | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-016> |\n| PRD-017 | Product & Catalogue | Product States & Availability | The system should ensure all product states (Coming Soon, Back in Soon, Unavailable) comply with Google Merchant Centre feed rules; products in ineligible states should not surface in product feeds. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-017> |\n| PRD-018 | Product & Catalogue | CTAs and Supporting Links | The system should display Add to Bag and Find in Boutique as primary CTAs; Find in Boutique should open as a side out. An inventory check condition must be applied: if the product is in stock, display \"Add to Bag\" as the primary CTA | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-019> |\n| PRD-019 | Product & Catalogue | CTAs and Supporting Links | The system should display a Wishlist icon alongside the primary CTA. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-019> |\n| PRD-020 | Product & Catalogue | CTAs and Supporting Links | The system should allow for a size selection first before clicking on the wishlist icon. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-020> |\n| PRD-021 | Product & Catalogue | CTAs and Supporting Links | The system should display an Unavailable link (opens slide out), Find My Size link, and Size Guide link. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-021> |\n| PRD-022 | Product & Catalogue | CTAs and Supporting Links | The system should display a Need Assistance section with links to email, live chat (with availability hours caveat), and Contact Us. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-022> |\n| ~~PRD-023~~ | ~~Product & Catalogue~~ | ~~Content Modules~~ | ~~The system should display an \"As Seen\" editorial imagery module, CMS-managed per product or collection.~~ | ~~Accenture~~ | ~~ALL~~ | ~~Custom~~ | ~~Confirmed~~ | Striking out this functional requirement on “As seen” recommendation zone as it has been replaced by new ones designed (Shop the edit, Complete the look, More from Category).  CC: @Dani Rivett | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-023> |\n| PRD-024 | Product & Catalogue | Content Modules | The system should display a \"Shop the Look\" module; clicking a product should navigate to its PDP; the module must auto-hide if no related products are populated and must exclude out-of-stock products. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-024> |\n| ~~PRD-025~~ | ~~Product & Catalogue~~ | ~~Content Modules~~ | ~~The system should display a \"Styling\" editorial content module as part of Shop the Look, applicable to dresses and jewellery; the module must auto-hide if related content or products are not populated and must not display for kids, men's, or other accessories.~~ |  | ~~ALL~~ | ~~Custom~~ | ~~Confirmed~~ | Striking out this functional requirement on styling copy on Shop the Look as not having this anymore.  CC: @Dani Rivett | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-025> |\n| PRD-026 | Product & Catalogue | Content Modules | The system should display a \"You May Also Like\" product carousel powered by the recommendations engine. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-026> |\n| PRD-027 | Product & Catalogue | Content Modules | The system should display a \"Recently Viewed\" carousel based on the customer's browsing session history. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Updated design: not a carousel but with button “See full history” | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-027> |\n| PRD-028 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should display a \"Find in Boutique\" CTA on the PDP for eligible products; the CTA should only display for products where in-store stock checking is supported. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-028> |\n| PRD-029 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should display at the top of the modal: a product thumbnail, product name, selected colour, and price. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-029> |\n| PRD-030 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should pre-populate the size selector within the modal with the variant selected on the PDP; the customer should be able to change size within the modal. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-030> |\n| PRD-031 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should provide a location search field input to filter boutique results. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-031> |\n| PRD-032 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should provide a \"Use My Location\" option that triggers browser geolocation to automatically filter boutique results by proximity; this should only activate with explicit customer permission. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-032> |\n| PRD-033 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should handle the scenario where a customer activates \"Use My Location\" but the browser cannot detect their location, displaying an appropriate inline message and allowing the customer to enter their location manually. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-033> |\n| PRD-034 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should support a maps experience for boutique directions, integrating with Google Maps. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-034> |\n| PRD-035 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should display boutique results showing: boutique name, address, distance from the customer's location (if geolocation permitted), and stock status (In Stock / Low Stock – Contact to Confirm Availability / Out of Stock) for the selected size. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Confirmed subject to the addition of the fields listed below:  It should also show the opening hours of the boutique, contact details and the current/live open status (eg. OPEN - CLOSES AT 6:00PM), a map to show the location and a view more button | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-035> |\n| PRD-036 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should provide a \"Get Directions\" link per boutique result, opening the location in a maps application. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-036> |\n| PRD-037 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should ensure the modal is fully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile breakpoints. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-037> |\n| PRD-038 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should recognise the Enter key as a search trigger in the Find in Boutique location search field. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-038> |\n| PRD-039 | Product & Catalogue | Find in Boutique | The system should support a configurable limit on the number of boutique results displayed in the Find in Boutique modal. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-039> |\n| PRD-040 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should display a stock alert CTA/link on the PDP when the selected size is out of stock. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-040> |\n| PRD-041 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should open a modal on CTA activation displaying the stock alert sign-up form. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-041> |\n| PRD-042 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should display at the top of the modal: product name and price (sourced from the ERP via the integration layer). | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Also display product image thumbnail | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-042> |\n| PRD-043 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should present a list of unavailable sizes for the customer to select; multiple size selection should be supported. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Current design works different - select for specific size, then click notify me. | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-043> |\n| PRD-044 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should capture customer name and email address as required fields; for authenticated customers, name and email should be pre-populated and remain editable. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-044> |\n| PRD-045 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should include a marketing opt-in / opt-out checkbox compliant with regional consent requirements; this must be gated by the marketing consent management platform (Omneo). | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-045> |\n| PRD-046 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should display a clear submission CTA to register the stock alert. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-046> |\n| PRD-047 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should display a confirmation message within the modal on successful submission. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-047> |\n| PRD-048 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should trigger a back-in-stock email to the configurable number of customers when inventory is replenished. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | The email is triggered to the first 30 clients once it is back in stock. If it is still in stock 30mins later (configurable amount of time) the email will trigger to the next 30 clients etc. @Manikandan Ramachandran (Deactivated) is this configurable in SFCC? This is custom build. @Tim Lavelle was this estimated? | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-048> |\n| PRD-049 | Product & Catalogue | Unavailable – Stock Alert | The system should receive stock replenishment signals flowing from NewStore to the commerce platform via the integration layer (MuleSoft), which in turn triggers the SFCC notification. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-049> |\n| PRD-050 | Product & Catalogue | Find My Size | ~~The system should update the \"Find My Size\" link on the PDP to display \"Recommended: Size X\" once a recommendation has been generated.~~  The system will display a Measmerize widget on the PDP to surface size recommendations. Once a recommendation has been generated by Measmerize, the system will update the CTA to display \"Recommended: Size X\". The behaviour and content of the recommendation are driven and managed by Measmerize. It will only display if Measmerize is set up for this product. | Measmerize | ALL |  | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-050> |\n| PRD-051 | Product & Catalogue | Find My Size | ~~The system should open the third step of the modal (recommended size view) when the customer clicks the \"Recommended\" link on the PDP.~~ | ~~Measmerize~~ | ALL |  | Cancelled |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-051> |\n| PRD-052 | Product & Catalogue | Find My Size | ~~The system should only display the \"Find My Size\" link on the PDP when Measmerize holds measurement data for the product; the link must be suppressed for products where no Measmerize data exists.~~ | ~~Measmerize~~ | ALL |  | Cancelled |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-052> |\n| PRD-053 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should open the Size Guide as a slide out overlay without navigating away from the PDP. | Measmerize | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Measmerize if data available - display Zimm size guide if not | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-053> |\n| PRD-054 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should display size conversion tables appropriate to the selected product; size guide content may differ between product types. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-054> |\n| PRD-055 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should manage Size Guide content as a structured content type within Contentful, supporting configuration per product type including but not limited to Ready to Wear, Swim, Accessories, Belts, Jewellery, Men's, Denim, and Hats. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-055> |\n| PRD-056 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should display measurements in both centimetres (cm) and inches, with a toggle to switch between units. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-056> |\n| PRD-057 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should ensure Size Guide content is manageable without a code deployment - via the CMS or the commerce platform's content tooling. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-057> |\n| PRD-058 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should display multiple images per product including front, back, detail, and model shots. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-058> |\n| PRD-059 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should display images in a gallery with thumbnail navigation. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-059> |\n| PRD-060 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should support hover-to-zoom or click-to-expand lightbox on the primary product image on desktop. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-060> |\n| PRD-061 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should support pinch-to-zoom and swipe-to-advance gallery navigation on mobile and touch devices. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-061> |\n| PRD-062 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should update the gallery to display the corresponding variant images when a colour swatch is selected, without a full page reload. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-062> |\n| PRD-063 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should serve images in an optimised format and at appropriate resolutions per device breakpoint to minimise page weight. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-063> |\n| PRD-064 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should priority-load the primary hero product image. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | The priority image on PDP may vary from product to product (could be flatlay, could be model view) and it could also be video | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-064> |\n| PRD-065 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should maintain a consistent image aspect ratio across all product. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | The system should also support multiple videos on the PDP (eg. studio, campaign, runway) | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-065> |\n| PRD-066 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should support optional video content (runway or model movement clips) within the image gallery carousel as a tile; video should play inline or expand to a lightbox. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Vimeo not 100% confirmed | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-066> |\n| PRD-067 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should source product video content from the video hosting platform (Vimeo) via an embed URL stored in the product data or CMS. |  | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-067> |\n| PRD-068 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should support configurable autoplay behaviour for PDP product videos, allowing autoplay to be enabled or disabled per video instance without a code deployment. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-068> |\n| PRD-069 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should support flexible image presentation per page type, including configurable background colour or treatment per page (e.g. PDP vs homepage vs bag), without requiring image asset duplication. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-069> |\n| PRD-070 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should enforce that alt text is present on all product images before a product can be published. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-070> |\n| PRD-071 | Product & Catalogue | External marketing product feeds | The system should support product catalogue feed provision through our existing feeds provider, Feedonomics. It should be possible to restrict the volume of product fed into Feedonomics at import rather than once the import is on the Feedonomics servers. The feeds should support product availability, stock positions, pricing, visibility, labels, and other metadata. |  | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Yes, the product fed volume can be controlled through job config. The OOTB product export is in CSV format. If you want a specific format, this will be a custom build. | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-071> |",
