et values that would return zero results when combined with already-applied filters | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-20> |\n| SPR-21 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system will apply OR logic within a facet (e.g. Red OR Blue) and AND logic across facets (e.g. Colour AND Size) | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-21> |\n| SPR-22 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support multi-select filtering within a facet group | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-22> |\n| SPR-23 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support global category filters including colour, size, material, and availability | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-23> |\n| SPR-24 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support category-specific facets (e.g. sleeve length) configurable per category | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-24> |\n| SPR-25 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must include print and pattern names as values within the Colour facet alongside solid colour values | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-25> |\n| SPR-26 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support the creation and management of colour swatches in Business Manager, e