ems\" as the~~ placeholder text in the search input | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-36> |\n| SPR-37 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must provide predictive autocomplete suggestions as customers type, surfacing relevant products, categories, and trending search terms | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-37> |\n| SPR-38 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a focused state when the search input is focused with no text, showing: Popular Searches (configured trending terms), category navigation shortcuts, and a product items grid | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-38> |\n| SPR-39 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must render the typed autocomplete as a two-panel layout: left panel showing keyword suggestion; right panel showing product items grid | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-39> |\n| SPR-40 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must include a \"View All\" link within the autocomplete panel, directing to the full search results page | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-40> |\n| SPR-41 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must surface category shortcut links within the autocomplete dropdown, allowing direct navigation to a category page without completing a full search | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22S